WEBVTT

1
00:00:08.271 --> 00:00:10.148
<b>ChatGPT Work can use the tools you</b>

2
00:00:10.148 --> 00:00:11.399
<b>already use for plugins.</b>

3
00:00:11.858 --> 00:00:13.234
<b>But some tools don't have a plugin.</b>

4
00:00:13.443 --> 00:00:14.777
<b>Others live in a desktop app</b>

5
00:00:14.777 --> 00:00:16.154
<b>or a website where I've already signed in.</b>

6
00:00:16.446 --> 00:00:17.322
<b>And that's where Computer</b>

7
00:00:17.322 --> 00:00:18.239
<b>use and Chrome use come in.</b>

8
00:00:18.865 --> 00:00:20.283
<b>They're only available in the Work tab</b>

9
00:00:20.283 --> 00:00:22.035
<b>with a ChatGPT desktop app, </b>

10
00:00:22.035 --> 00:00:23.578
<b>not in regular ChatGPT, </b>

11
00:00:23.578 --> 00:00:25.079
<b>on the web, or on your phone.</b>

12
00:00:25.663 --> 00:00:27.415
<b>Computer use lets ChatGPT </b>

13
00:00:27.415 --> 00:00:28.791
<b>use desktop apps just like you do.</b>

14
00:00:29.292 --> 00:00:30.543
<b>You can click, type, and</b>

15
00:00:30.543 --> 00:00:31.753
<b>move between apps and windows.</b>

16
00:00:32.003 --> 00:00:33.588
<b>Chrome uses is the same thing in your browser,</b>

17
00:00:33.755 --> 00:00:35.590
<b> using websites where you're already signed in.</b>

18
00:00:36.174 --> 00:00:37.633
<b>And both can work in the background </b>

19
00:00:37.633 --> 00:00:38.760
<b>so you can keep using your computer.</b>

20
00:00:39.093 --> 00:00:41.095
<b>Before accessing an app or website, </b>

21
00:00:41.346 --> 00:00:42.805
<b>ChatGPT asks for permission.</b>

22
00:00:43.181 --> 00:00:44.724
<b>You can allow it once or let it remember</b>

23
00:00:44.724 --> 00:00:45.683
<b>your choice for next time.</b>

24
00:00:46.017 --> 00:00:47.393
<b>I'm using dictation here, </b>

25
00:00:47.393 --> 00:00:48.853
<b>so I can say what I need instead of typing it.</b>

26
00:00:49.812 --> 00:00:51.147
<b>Play my daylist on Spotify.</b>

27
00:00:51.689 --> 00:00:53.024
<b>This is a small task,</b>

28
00:00:53.024 --> 00:00:54.317
<b>but it makes the distinction clear.</b>

29
00:00:54.817 --> 00:00:55.568
<b>There isn't a special</b>

30
00:00:55.568 --> 00:00:56.736
<b>Spotify integration here.</b>

31
00:00:56.986 --> 00:00:57.945
<b>ChatGPT is using the</b>

32
00:00:57.945 --> 00:00:59.614
<b>desktop app I already use.</b>

33
00:00:59.947 --> 00:01:01.741
<b>On a Mac, it can handle a task like this</b>

34
00:01:01.741 --> 00:01:02.992
<b>in the background while I keep working.</b>

35
00:01:03.201 --> 00:01:04.118
<b>I can watch it,</b>

36
00:01:04.118 --> 00:01:06.079
<b>take over, or stop whenever I want.</b>

37
00:01:06.579 --> 00:01:08.581
<b>And if I want to show ChatGPT what I'm looking at,</b>

38
00:01:08.581 --> 00:01:10.333
<b>I can press Command Command</b>

39
00:01:10.416 --> 00:01:11.542
<b> to take an appshot</b>

40
00:01:12.126 --> 00:01:13.586
<b>It works with apps or websites</b>

41
00:01:13.586 --> 00:01:15.171
<b>and is like a screenshot with context.</b>

42
00:01:15.421 --> 00:01:17.048
<b>So ChatGPT can see and understand</b>

43
00:01:17.048 --> 00:01:18.424
<b>what I'm looking at without me</b>

44
00:01:18.424 --> 00:01:19.425
<b>having to explain everything.</b>

45
00:01:19.801 --> 00:01:21.469
<b>Chrome lets ChatGPT work</b>

46
00:01:21.469 --> 00:01:22.845
<b>in a browser I already use,</b>

47
00:01:22.887 --> 00:01:24.514
<b>including websites where I'm signed in.</b>

48
00:01:25.139 --> 00:01:26.391
<b>I'm going on vacation next month.</b>

49
00:01:26.766 --> 00:01:28.601
<b>Can you prepare a PTO request on Workday</b>

50
00:01:28.601 --> 00:01:30.395
<b>for September 14th and 15th?</b>

51
00:01:30.395 --> 00:01:33.481
<b>Check my calendar for conflicts and draft</b>

52
00:01:33.481 --> 00:01:35.108
<b>an out-of-office event for the same dates.</b>

53
00:01:35.733 --> 00:01:37.318
<b>Show me both drafts and stop</b>

54
00:01:37.318 --> 00:01:39.070
<b>before submitting the PTO request</b>

55
00:01:39.070 --> 00:01:40.196
<b>or create an encounter event.</b>

56
00:01:40.696 --> 00:01:42.281
<b>Workday doesn’t have a plugin,</b>

57
00:01:42.281 --> 00:01:43.241
<b> so Chrome use handles </b>

58
00:01:43.241 --> 00:01:44.909
<b>the part that normally means opening tabs </b>

59
00:01:44.909 --> 00:01:45.618
<b>and filling out the form.</b>

60
00:01:46.035 --> 00:01:46.953
<b>And this is why Chrome use</b>

61
00:01:46.953 --> 00:01:48.121
<b>and plugins work well together.</b>

62
00:01:48.621 --> 00:01:50.164
<b>ChatGPT uses the browser for Workday</b>

63
00:01:50.164 --> 00:01:51.416
<b>because there's no plugin.</b>

64
00:01:51.624 --> 00:01:53.251
<b>And then it uses the Google Calendar plugin</b>

65
00:01:53.251 --> 00:01:54.210
<b>to check my schedule and</b>

66
00:01:54.210 --> 00:01:55.503
<b>prepare the out-of-office event.</b>

67
00:01:55.920 --> 00:01:56.796
<b>And it stops there.</b>

68
00:01:57.255 --> 00:01:58.131
<b>The request is filled out,</b>

69
00:01:58.548 --> 00:01:59.465
<b>the calendar event is ready.</b>

70
00:02:00.216 --> 00:02:01.717
<b>But submitting PTO and creating an event</b>

71
00:02:01.717 --> 00:02:03.219
<b>are real changes, </b>

72
00:02:03.219 --> 00:02:04.345
<b>so I get to review them first.</b>

73
00:02:04.512 --> 00:02:06.180
<b>This is how I use ChatGPT Work.</b>

74
00:02:06.180 --> 00:02:08.307
<b>I want ChatGPT to take on the tedious steps,</b>

75
00:02:08.474 --> 00:02:09.892
<b>and I still want the final decision</b>

76
00:02:09.892 --> 00:02:11.394
<b>when something affects my calendar,</b>

77
00:02:11.394 --> 00:02:12.645
<b>my team, or another system.</b>

78
00:02:13.354 --> 00:02:15.106
<b>For me, the simple rule is:</b>

79
00:02:15.106 --> 00:02:16.607
<b>Use a plugin when there's a direct route</b>

80
00:02:16.607 --> 00:02:17.483
<b>to the tool you need,</b>

81
00:02:17.775 --> 00:02:19.193
<b>choose computer use when the work lives</b>

82
00:02:19.193 --> 00:02:20.528
<b>on a desktop app</b>

83
00:02:20.528 --> 00:02:21.571
<b>and choose Chrome use</b>

84
00:02:21.571 --> 00:02:22.447
<b>when the work lives in a browser </b>

85
00:02:22.447 --> 00:02:23.448
<b>you're already signed into.</b>

86
00:02:23.823 --> 00:02:25.450
<b>A PTO request ready to submit,</b>

87
00:02:25.450 --> 00:02:27.160
<b>and an out-of-office event ready to create.</b>

88
00:02:27.618 --> 00:02:28.703
<b>That's ChatGPT Work.</b>
